OL,3,GNEWSAMan stormed Jewish wedding on hate
OL,4,Aspree, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jewish man who was victim of
OL,7,Fantisemitic abuse after a man stormed
OL,8,Finto his brother's wedding reception
OL,9,Fhas described his "fear" and "shock"
OL,10,Fthat left him feeling nervous about
OL,11,Fattending large Jewish gatherings.
OL,13,FJack Surpree, had been best man at the
OL,14,Fwedding at a hotel in Liverpool when he
OL,15,Fwas confronted by Joseph Nixon, 43, who
OL,16,Fstarted shouting at guests in what a
OL,17,Fcourt heard was a "hate spree".
OL,19,F"In that moment all I could see was
OL,20,Fhatred and evil," Surpree said in a
OL,21,Fvictim impact statement read to the
OL,22,Fcourt.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
